    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the melted butter, heavy cream, eggs, and vanilla extract. Whisk it together until combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-blueberry-muffins/#wprm-recipe-54491-step-0-3",
