      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Keto-Blueberry-Muffins-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the batter into the muffin pan evenly. Top with extra blueberries. Bake in the oven for 20 minutes or until a toothpick inserted comes out clean.",
